<title>UK: Morgan Crucible lifts H1 pretax 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Morgan Crucible lifts H1 pretax 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to July 4</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.7		   vs 12.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.6		    vs 6.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     51.4		   vs 42.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   459.4		  vs 415.3</p>
<p>NOTE - UK specialised industrial chemicals and services group Morgan Crucible Co Plc said pretax profits were before an exceptional gain of 4.2 million stg on a sale. The company said order intake was about six percent higher than last year.</p>
<p> Operating result	 57.6		   vs 50.0</p>
<p> Interest (payable)     8.2		    vs 8.2</p>
<p> Tax			  15.9		   vs 13.0</p>
<p> Net taxed		  3.5		    vs 29.0</p>
<p> Retained		   18.7		   vs 13.4</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 6, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  Oct 29</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
